{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261102/photo/bkn-20261102120057199-1102_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261102145605\"/><p>事主被送往將軍澳醫院治理。</p><p>將軍澳工業邨發生工業意外。今晨(2日)11時36分，駿日街16號職員報案，指姓林(51歲)男工友於上址工作期間受傷。救護員接報到場，將手傷清醒的林男送往將軍澳醫院治理。警員經初步調查，相信林男於上址工作期間意外被機器割傷左手。案件列「工業意外—有人意外受傷」處理。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T07:00:56.154891+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":154,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T04:00:57+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T12:18:24.274396+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T06:58:44.712225+00:00","content_hash":"cde3b6065d29e71d3c23ba3b84aefd9ab55648c335a5bba4042b3d0d2746596c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}